{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And sometimes the cloud was there a number of days.</b> A third case: sometimes their encampment was in places agreeable for them and for their livestock, and there the cloud would remain a number of days more than anywhere else." "<b>At the word of HaShem they encamped.</b> Not out of fondness for that place." "<b>And at the word of HaShem they journeyed.</b> Even though they were departing from that good place."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:11.023382698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}